          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(ii) If the sum of the digits of a number is divisible by 9, then the number is divisible by 9."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.192,
            0.129,
            0.847,
            0.168
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(iii) If a number is not divisible by 9, then the sum of its digits is not divisible by 9."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.196,
            0.171,
            0.847,
            0.21
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(iv) If the sum of the digits of a number is not divisible by 9, then the number is not divisible by 9."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.104,
            0.232,
            0.187,
            0.285
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
